{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 880292611, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 60, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 13:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "量不够  小作文骗不到多少人啊  光大哥二哥都换不出太多筹码。<br/>主力是很努力的诱多了  可惜散户不太好骗啊。", "lou": 700, "content_length": 94, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788240832}, {"pid": 880292759, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 32, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 13:35", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880292641,47288722,1836]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=41412356]兴趣使然的PRODUCER[/uid] (2026-09-01 13:34):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大 如果说刚才那种拉升是培养抄底习惯 奖励上午抄底科技的散户<br/>现在这个回落 是不是也是一种诱多 给刚才没抄底的散户一次买进的机会 毕竟刚才拉得有点快 回落的也快<br/>难道这几分钟就做好了差价[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>那不会<br/>还在持续过程中。只是不及预期 不是表示诱多动作完了", "lou": 701, "content_length": 59, "reply_to": 880292641, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788240921}, {"pid": 880293024, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 53, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 13:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880292836,47288722,1836]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67145714]Plezl[/uid] (2026-09-01 13:36):[/b]<br/><br/>与其说是散户不太好骗，我倒觉得是大部分散户已经没钱补仓了[/quote]<br/>那不行啊  如果主力确认榨干了的话 那诱多这个动作就没了噢 <br/>没人看这里能反转的。<br/>一大堆大科技的钱都出不来  他们想换别的板块都换不了  <br/>必须要有人去大科技里填坑别的板块才能可能走出新主线啊。", "lou": 702, "content_length": 179, "reply_to": 880292836, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788241083}, {"pid": 880293437, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 53, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 13:42", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "刚才要是半导体的小作文保证没人辟谣 <br/>用错方向了啊  上面一大堆公墓<br/>可惜了 <br/>刚才如果过了4000 半导体拉回来，那就是最棒的局面了<br/>接下来这些人在4000的大科技里拼搏  主力就去别的地方玩了。<br/><br/>主要还是这个小作文级别不够力 辟谣太早了", "lou": 703, "content_length": 206, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788241348}, {"pid": 880293537, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 63, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 13:43", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880293343,47288722,1838]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=42729207]fable1777[/uid] (2026-09-01 13:41):[/b]<br/><br/>没想明白他们作死的拉银行砸科技，能骗到谁啊。。。[/quote]<br/>如果我是主力 我就不用小作文了  开外资账户去拉韩国半导体算了", "lou": 704, "content_length": 61, "reply_to": 880293343, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788241411}, {"pid": 880293936, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 42, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 13:47", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880293783,47288722,1839]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67145714]Plezl[/uid] (2026-09-01 13:46):[/b]<br/><br/>因为我自己周边了解下来还有上周我券商朋友跟我边打游戏边聊的，很多账户7月以后都几乎变成死户了，忘了啥指标环比下降了30%多[/quote]<br/>不够干  继续榨  榨到连账户都不开了才行。", "lou": 705, "content_length": 41, "reply_to": 880293783, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788241665}, {"pid": 880294346, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 108, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 13:51", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "MD 这种操盘也太糙了  <br/>如果刚才用的是半导体小作文 肯定没人辟谣，然后配合韩国冲一下  <br/>半导体至少可以走出一个分时ABC<br/>那4000就稳稳过，然后就不会缩量反而能持续放量<br/><br/>这得是多蠢的人才能操成这样的盘口啊。", "lou": 706, "content_length": 185, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788241918}, {"pid": 880294902, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 51, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 13:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880294570,47288722,1841]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=40796551]凌果冻[/uid] (2026-09-01 13:54):[/b]<br/><br/>只是因为你买的是半导体所以才希望是半导体的小作文[s:ac:闪光][/quote]<br/>跟这个没关系 光大哥二哥里面那些公墓你多大的小作文都上不去的  每涨1个点都是无限的卖盘<br/>半导体足够分散 问题不大的。随便用哪个细分都可以带一波 哪怕他用存储我觉得都是对的。<br/>长鑫大哥的消息还没体现呢。", "lou": 707, "content_length": 192, "reply_to": 880294570, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788242253}, {"pid": 880295120, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 41, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 13:59", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880295033,47288722,1842]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67177520]Amam2haruna[/uid] (2026-09-01 13:59):[/b]<br/><br/>是不是可能意思是现在在操弄盘口的大资金可能主要阵地在光那边而不是半导体那边 所以小作文才放在自己的自留地希望可以最大化利益[/quote]<br/>那我不管他  按结果来看他的操作就是蠢", "lou": 708, "content_length": 39, "reply_to": 880295033, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788242394}, {"pid": 880297242, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 73, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 14:20", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880297048,47288722,1846]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67177520]Amam2haruna[/uid] (2026-09-01 14:18):[/b]<br/><br/>现在这个情况是止损出去好还是再拿着看看比较好 我抄的位置也差不多在现价附近 出去的话应该是是没赚没亏这样 不过还是有期待明后天能V一把再走的[/quote]<br/>急什么鬼<br/>这个波动连手续费都不够。<br/>你们持仓时间已经越来越短了", "lou": 709, "content_length": 63, "reply_to": 880297048, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788243605}, {"pid": 880299038, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 60, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 14:35", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我液冷 国算  甚至券商 化工都吃上了 <br/>半导体我就做个T我还怕什么啊。。。我又不是追高 我-3%以下抄的我怕什么啊。", "lou": 710, "content_length": 100, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788244513}, {"pid": 880301439, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 79, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 14:54", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "可惜了  到收盘了  亏个手续费出来 <br/>明天再说", "lou": 711, "content_length": 36, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788245658}, {"pid": 880301815, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 36, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 14:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880301659,47288722,1851]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67145714]Plezl[/uid] (2026-09-01 14:56):[/b]<br/><br/>还是感觉科技只能短打，能吃一点是一点的那种[/quote]<br/>要不是光的小作文搅局我就吃上了", "lou": 712, "content_length": 35, "reply_to": 880301659, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788245863}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283296, "replies": 37097, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1788251595, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "kaleColourWgw", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1788251642, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1788251328, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [